 de l'Economie 

00:38:52.920 --> 00:39:01.160 line:61%
 et des Finances. 

00:39:01.200 --> 00:39:04.840 line:63%
 - Bruno Le Maire: 
 Monsieur le député, 

00:39:04.880 --> 00:39:12.920 line:63%
