 Nous veillerons 
 à ce que la loi EGalim 

00:41:01.040 --> 00:41:02.040 line:61%
 soit renforcée. 

00:41:02.080 --> 00:41:03.240 line:63%
 - Thierry Benoit: 
 Il me reste 

00:41:03.280 --> 00:41:05.400 line:61%
