 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: 
 La parole 

00:41:48.520 --> 00:41:49.520 line:63%
 est à monsieur 
 Philippe Schreck 

00:41:49.560 --> 00:41:56.560 line:61%
 pour le Rassemblement National. 

